 class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5f966a5415552b4e\" href=\"?note=5f966a5415552b4e\" title=\"67-df-recursive-function-class\">67-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f76c99f69499336d\" href=\"?note=f76c99f69499336d\" title=\"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma\">67-thm-fixed-point-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 12"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"33"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"44"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq Q\">\\(T\\supseteq Q\\)</span> 是一致的固定原始递归公理呈示，使用本册固定句法与证明编号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9f0e08fd1022847c\" href=\"?note=9f0e08fd1022847c\" title=\"67-df-consistent\">67-df-consistent</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_T\">\\(\\ell_T\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofLength}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofLength}_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"45046cfa53052599\" href=\"?note=45046cfa53052599\" title=\"67-df-proof-length\">67-df-proof-length</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5f966a5415552b4e\" href=\"?note=5f966a5415552b4e\" title=\"67-df-recursive-function-class\">67-df-recursive-function-class</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> 表示上述固定自然原始递归句法编号；句法对象与自然数编码、对象语言数词分别使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本原子固定的编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 与所引 Proof_T、Prf_T、Prov_T 采用的呈示编号相同；所有编码变换均在该固定编号下使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本条的固定编号为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span>。每个出现的有效理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 绑定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a> 的呈示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_A\">\\(E_A\\)</span>；使用内部证明公式时固定同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\">\\(\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\quad\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\quad\nT\\vdash\\varphi\\land\\ell_T(g(\\varphi))&gt;f(g(\\varphi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\quad\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\quad\nT\\vdash\\varphi\\land\\ell_T(g(\\varphi))&gt;f(g(\\varphi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 2.12, p.33。取固定点 φ，断言在某个递归函数值所给界内没有自己的证明。若界内真有证明，Q 的逐数验证反驳 φ，违背 T 一致性；若没有，Q 可验证该有限事实并证明 φ。将原书构造中的界取 f(n)+1，得到这里严格 &gt;f(n) 的版本。旧条目只断言无限定理集的证明长度无界，失去“任何递归函数都不能按结论编码统一给界”的内容。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-proof-length","status":"resolved","id":"45046cfa53052599","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-proof-length]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"9f0e08fd1022847c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]